{"item_id": "830c1029230e4588", "kind": "post", "source_id": "bilibili", "source_name": "B 站", "title": "Vibe Coding 完不会获客？我用 AI 做了一个「营销数据库」！【B站AI创造公开赛】", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1cVW86JE2e", "project_url": null, "author": "熠辉IndieDev", "author_url": "https://space.bilibili.com/39930228", "published_at": "2026-11-10T09:00:00+08:00", "captured_at": "2026-11-21T14:55:50+08:00", "lang": "zh", "body": "产品做出来了，第一批用户去哪找？我用两个月做了 BizPeel，收录700多个公开营收的产品，拆解真实获客动作。本期演示在 Google Antigravity 接入 BizPeel MCP，由 Gemini 4 Argon 查找同类产品、整理增长实验；报告生成时用 Gemini Flash 清洗数据，再由 Gemini 4 Argon 撰写。\n\n注： 部分Google技术仅适用于出海场景。", "body_format": "text", "comments": [], "comments_total": 0, "comments_truncated": false, "metrics": {"play": 76334, "danmaku": 3, "favorites": 2521}, "tags": ["Google 出海创新竞赛单元", "B站AI创造公开赛", "AI Agent", "Google Cloud", "Gemini", "Google", "独立开发"], "links": [], "discovered_via": "bili:独立开发", "extra": {"bvid": "BV1cVW86JE2e", "query": "独立开发", "project_url_rejected": "讨论页/聚合站/文档站｜https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1cVW86JE2e", "layer": "signal"}, "body_completeness": "metadata_only", "record_type": "update", "run_id": "20261121T144454"}
{"item_id": "5300c000309f1743", "kind": "post", "source_id": "bilibili", "source_name": "B 站", "title": "用 AI 写代码做的游戏，48 小时卖了 35.6 万美元，这个韩国开发者花了一年时间", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1o2sN6kEki", "project_url": null, "author": "i陆三金", "author_url": "https://space.bilibili.com/22217019", "published_at": "2026-11-16T22:28:03+08:00", "captured_at": "2026-11-21T14:55:50+08:00", "lang": "zh", "body": "一个此前没做过游戏的韩国独立开发者，2025 年 10 月开始用 AI 写代码，一个人做了一款旋转轮盘 + 自走棋 + 肉鸽游戏。\n \n没有团队，也没有发行商，Steam 上线 48 小时流水 35.6 万美元，卖出 5 万份，同时在线峰值 1.5 万人。", "body_format": "text", "comments": [], "comments_total": 0, "comments_truncated": false, "metrics": {"play": 58818, "danmaku": 17, "favorites": 1523}, "tags": ["游戏开发", "AI", "人工智能"], "links": [], "discovered_via": "bili:独立开发", "extra": {"bvid": "BV1o2sN6kEki", "query": "独立开发", "project_url_rejected": "讨论页/聚合站/文档站｜https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1o2sN6kEki", "layer": "signal"}, "body_completeness": "metadata_only", "record_type": "update", "run_id": "20261121T144454"}
