{"item_id": "a875a62c3c700e9d", "kind": "post", "source_id": "bilibili", "source_name": "B 站", "title": "决定做独立游戏前，先想清楚……", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1nVsp6FEX2", "project_url": null, "author": "Gaby学姐说", "author_url": "https://space.bilibili.com/3546782527130177", "published_at": "2026-11-15T20:03:48+08:00", "captured_at": "2026-11-21T14:55:50+08:00", "lang": "zh", "body": "两个人两个月卖了 2000 万份，谁看了不想说一句“我上我也行”？\n可就算打进 Steam 前 8%，三个人做两年，人均月入也就 6500 左右。\n决定做独立游戏之前，先想清楚四件事：这笔账怎么算、项目怎么立、凭什么被看见、扛不扛得住。", "body_format": "text", "comments": [], "comments_total": 0, "comments_truncated": false, "metrics": {"play": 8524, "danmaku": 58, "favorites": 417}, "tags": ["游戏开发", "独立游戏发行", "万物研究所", "独立游戏开发者", "steam", "游戏杂谈", "独立游戏"], "links": [], "discovered_via": "bili:独立开发", "extra": {"bvid": "BV1nVsp6FEX2", "query": "独立开发", "project_url_rejected": "讨论页/聚合站/文档站｜https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1nVsp6FEX2", "layer": "signal"}, "body_completeness": "metadata_only", "record_type": "update", "run_id": "20261121T144454"}
{"item_id": "92d5c8b5d06bc86b", "kind": "post", "source_id": "bilibili", "source_name": "B 站", "title": "数字游民必看 | 独立开发者的出海赚钱实战经验分享!", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1d9dKYxEiX", "project_url": null, "author": "OpenBuild开源社区", "author_url": "https://space.bilibili.com/483336099", "published_at": "2025-04-09T23:45:52+08:00", "captured_at": "2026-11-21T14:55:51+08:00", "lang": "zh", "body": "主持人: 秋秋 @0xqiuqiuu\n嘉宾: Levi Yuan@leviyuen\n\n本期我们 OpenBuild 有幸采访到资深独立开发者 Levi Yuan，分享他如何从传统职场转型为独立开发者，并成功实现出海接单赚取美金的宝贵经验。\n\n嘉宾介绍: \nLevi 个人分享，35被裁员，自学编程，独立开发🧑‍💻\n\n分享内容\n1.为什么选择独立开发 \n2.通过软件赚美金为什么是一个不错的商业模式 \n3.我是如何从0到1学习编程的 \n4.我从独立开发到成为数字游民的经历分享", "body_format": "text", "comments": [], "comments_total": 0, "comments_truncated": false, "metrics": {"play": 41130, "danmaku": 7, "favorites": 3085}, "tags": ["互联网", "Web3", "经验分享", "项目", "数字游民", "独立开发者"], "links": [], "discovered_via": "bili:独立开发者 出海", "extra": {"bvid": "BV1d9dKYxEiX", "query": "独立开发者 出海", "project_url_rejected": "讨论页/聚合站/文档站｜https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1d9dKYxEiX", "layer": "signal"}, "body_completeness": "metadata_only", "record_type": "update", "run_id": "20261121T144454"}
{"item_id": "9da893e06d4b9e78", "kind": "post", "source_id": "bilibili", "source_name": "B 站", "title": "失踪人口回归！我的第一个出海产品，是怎样冷启动赚到第一个 100 美元的？", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1kBQeYiEpv", "project_url": "https://tailwindresume.co/", "author": "独立开发者Viking", "author_url": "https://space.bilibili.com/480241067", "published_at": "2025-03-17T09:13:22+08:00", "captured_at": "2026-11-21T14:55:51+08:00", "lang": "zh", "body": "失踪人口回归！去年九月份我当爸爸了，我们夫妻两人独立带娃，时间少了很多，所以更新频率降低了很多，在今年 2 月份还是完成了人生一个里程碑的事件，我的第一个出海产品，简单简历的英文版：TailwindResume https://tailwindresume.co/ 正式上线了。直接说结论，我通过冷启动的方式在两周内收获 50 个用户，赚到了 100 美元，不是特别惊人，所以非常真实，是每个想出海的独立开发者都可以完全复制的经验，下面是整个过程的记录。\n\n文字版：https://vikingz.me/fir", "body_format": "text", "comments": [], "comments_total": 0, "comments_truncated": false, "metrics": {"play": 10850, "danmaku": 2, "favorites": 712}, "tags": ["AI IN ALL！", "出海", "全栈开发", "一人公司", "编程", "自由职业", "独立开发", "前端开发"], "links": ["https://tailwindresume.co/", "https://vikingz.me/fir"], "discovered_via": "bili:独立开发者 出海", "extra": {"bvid": "BV1kBQeYiEpv", "query": "独立开发者 出海", "project_url_rejected": "讨论页/聚合站/文档站｜https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1kBQeYiEpv", "layer": "signal"}, "body_completeness": "metadata_only", "record_type": "update", "run_id": "20261121T144454"}
{"item_id": "c9c9c26c1a9ab5ed", "kind": "post", "source_id": "bilibili", "source_name": "B 站", "title": "【中配】月入7.7万美元的独立开发者，每天只工作4小时？他的秘诀竟然是疯狂发布产品！", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1QVLp6dEMC", "project_url": null, "author": "EdgeAITech", "author_url": "https://space.bilibili.com/280973906", "published_at": "2026-05-21T06:31:00+08:00", "captured_at": "2026-11-21T14:55:51+08:00", "lang": "zh", "body": "Marc Lou 是一名月入 7.7 万美元的独立创业者，创办了 35 家初创公司。很多人好奇他是如何完成这么多事情的？在这期视频中，他分享了自己一天的工作流程和核心习惯：从早上的深度工作、完全离线，到不断发布新产品、快速迭代。他揭示了成功的秘诀不是追求完美，而是持续发布、不断试错。如果你也想提高效率、打造自己的事业，这个视频会给你带来启发。\n\n📖 章节时间轴\n\n00:00 认识 Marc Lou\n00:52 早晨例行与深度工作\n02:34 持续发布与失败率\n03:42 发布新应用的过程\n04:42 好奇", "body_format": "text", "comments": [], "comments_total": 0, "comments_truncated": false, "metrics": {"play": 43584, "danmaku": 39, "favorites": 2515}, "tags": ["独立创业者", "EdgeAITech", "Marc Lou", "具身智能", "深度工作", "大模型", "AI", "人工智能"], "links": [], "discovered_via": "bili:独立开发者 出海", "extra": {"bvid": "BV1QVLp6dEMC", "query": "独立开发者 出海", "project_url_rejected": "讨论页/聚合站/文档站｜https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1QVLp6dEMC", "layer": "signal"}, "body_completeness": "metadata_only", "record_type": "update", "run_id": "20261121T144454"}
{"item_id": "0c1a6d3f2e3f5140", "kind": "post", "source_id": "bilibili", "source_name": "B 站", "title": "做了个新项目，我要出海了！", "url": "https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1mAAmzqEfP", "project_url": null, "author": "程序员鱼皮", "author_url": "https://space.bilibili.com/12890453", "published_at": "2026-02-27T12:55:15+08:00", "captured_at": "2026-11-21T14:55:51+08:00", "lang": "zh", "body": "我用 AI 编程开发了 GitHub 文档翻译平台，让你的开源项目轻松出海。项目全程直播开发，99% 以上的代码都是 AI 写的，代码已开源！\n编程学习教程+实战项目+简历模板：codefather.cn\n视频详细讲解了如何用 Cursor 搭配 MCP 插件和 Agent Skills，用 AI 完成需求调研、方案设计、前后端并行开发、测试验收到部署上线的全流程。技术栈涵盖 Next.js 全栈开发、TypeScript、Prisma、MySQL 数据库、GitHub App 安全授权、OpenRout", "body_format": "text", "comments": [], "comments_total": 0, "comments_truncated": false, "metrics": {"play": 91171, "danmaku": 112, "favorites": 4711}, "tags": ["科技猎手", "Cursor", "AI编程", "AI", "编程", "GitHub", "大模型", "软件应用", "计算机", "教程"], "links": [], "discovered_via": "bili:独立开发者 出海", "extra": {"bvid": "BV1mAAmzqEfP", "query": "独立开发者 出海", "project_url_rejected": "讨论页/聚合站/文档站｜https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1mAAmzqEfP", "layer": "signal"}, "body_completeness": "metadata_only", "record_type": "update", "run_id": "20261121T144454"}
